{"name": "Lost Soul", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lost soul is a roguelite action-platformer. inspired by deadcells, and hades. You'll\u00a0explore an ever-changing Tower with a 2D souls-lite combat. and try to uncover the mysteries behind the tower and the history of its world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/b99fea7bed12dfdd1c7fab3f72efdc60.poster.avif?t=1787960606\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/b99fea7bed12dfdd1c7fab3f72efdc60.webm?t=1787960606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/b99fea7bed12dfdd1c7fab3f72efdc60.mp4?t=1787960606\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lost Soul is a roguelite action-platformer with soul-lite combat. A precise movements and controls that will test your reflexes. With progression inspired by games like hades and deadcells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/764ebbca085bbdecc2cc9fd8d01a649e.poster.avif?t=1787960606\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/764ebbca085bbdecc2cc9fd8d01a649e.webm?t=1787960606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/764ebbca085bbdecc2cc9fd8d01a649e.mp4?t=1787960606\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lost soul puts you in control of a young adventurer who wakes up in a strange tower without memories of his past or why he is here. In a never ending circle of fighting monsters and death. The more monsters he defeats the more he uncovers his memories and the stronger he gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/5bb8ba9ebeb9e21c20b8b283b048a3ab.poster.avif?t=1787960606\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/5bb8ba9ebeb9e21c20b8b283b048a3ab.webm?t=1787960606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/5bb8ba9ebeb9e21c20b8b283b048a3ab.mp4?t=1787960606\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the path of exploring this tower he meets friends, foes and opportunities to get stronger. Would he be able to unveil the mysteries of the tower and recover his memories?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/2b0e41191c85d89abdb1916462553dee.poster.avif?t=1787960606\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/2b0e41191c85d89abdb1916462553dee.webm?t=1787960606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/extras/2b0e41191c85d89abdb1916462553dee.mp4?t=1787960606\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Souls-lite combat with precise controls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn frame by frame animations and art. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast interconnected ever-changing Tower of unknown origins.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recover your memories, develop your new abilities and grow to new heights to defeat stronger enemies and unveil the mysteries of the Tower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trailer Music: an edited version of</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\"Rynos Theme\" by Kevin MacLeod (incompetech)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Lost soul is a roguelite action-platformer. inspired by deadcells, and hades. You'll\u00a0explore an ever-changing Tower with a 2D souls-lite combat.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570300/dd7167c4cd71f6972cc3d73a687a4ad9629df8e2/header.jpg?t=1787960606", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Roguelite", "Souls-like", "Difficult", "Perma Death", "Indie"], "developers": "Abdallah Mohamed, Ahmed Kotp", "publishers": "Abdallah Mohamed, Ahmed Kotp", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2570300", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "30 April 2026 - Request Access\n\n24 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/zOSGu4GqKxU", "first_seen": 1777500000.0, "review_rank": 741}